{"root":{"data":{"id":"djdk8g7hazk0","created":1781926524139,"text":"以保障和改善民生为重点加强社会建设"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djdkcvr7jd40","created":1781926871440,"text":"让人民生活幸福是“国之大者” "},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djdkeo7ycxk0","created":1781927011767,"text":"让人民生活幸福是“国之大者”"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djdker1d3lc0","created":1781927017899,"text":"  - 增进民生福祉是坚持立党为公、 执政为民的本质要求。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djdker1dids0","created":1781927017900,"text":"  - 增进民生福祉是社会主义生产的根本目的 "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djdker1dxd40","created":1781927017900,"text":"  - 增进民生福祉是全面建设社会主义现代化国家的应有之义  "},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"djdkesnxczc0","created":1781927021440,"text":"分支主题"},"children":[]}]}]},"template":"default","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}